                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game's been my childhood, but playing this again... honestly it really needs a lot of polishing lol, that and the physics can fuck you over sometimes when trying to do prestige\n\nyou can also buy the same skin over and over for some reason, instead of buying it once and being able to choose between them for no cost\n\nit's still pretty fun though",
